{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>現年45歲的港姐亞軍楊洛婷與Dear Jane主音黃天翱（Tim）結婚多年，育有一女一子，一家四口生活美滿。向來給人溫哥華長大、「鬼妹仔」性格印象的楊洛婷，對子女照顧無微不至，原來私底下對傳統中醫調理亦相當信服。</p><figure><img alt=\"楊洛婷同老公樂隊Dear Jane主音Tim黃天翱慶好恩愛。（IG：@rabeeayeung）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250509/997573390019989504349701.jpeg/g2EAbwGuGq3QhhZCDR9WEvggX8BUvuMizQZzYs0Gc2I\"/><figcaption>楊洛婷同老公樂隊Dear Jane主音Tim黃天翱慶好恩愛。（IG：@rabeeayeung）</figcaption></figure><p>仔仔發燒身骨痛　楊洛婷火速帶睇中醫拔罐</p><p>日前楊洛婷在社交平台限時動態分享細仔Tristan（黃仔）的最新近況。她上載了一張Tristan趴在診療床上的照片，透露細仔今早出現發燒及全身不適的情況：「呢位小朋友今朝發燒，佢話全身都好唔舒服…即刻帶佢嚟搵⋯⋯」。</p><p>照片中所見，中醫師正拿着火種為Tristan進行傳統拔罐及刮痧療法，過程相當專業。雖然小朋友年纪輕輕，但在接受治療期間表現得非常乖巧。</p><figure><img alt=\"咁細個原來可以拔罐！（IG截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261009/1185288734879387648357814.png/r-JYoxgcRtscrFvZAzXUkFWos1QG7xUL4Szt4OEs7eA\"/><figcaption>咁細個原來可以拔罐！（IG截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"好精靈！（IG截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261009/1185288729724456960203897.png/xDWDwM-BSzSBcLXM71uwIg21Rm9XAhaIzq_Z8s6v2fI\"/><figcaption>好精靈！（IG截圖）</figcaption></figure><p>治療效果顯著　細仔即刻變回「Little KOL」</p><p>經中醫拔罐調理後，Tristan的身體狀況顯然迅速好轉。楊洛婷隨後貼出一張細仔在石板街上的近照，只見戴着眼鏡的Tristan精神奕奕，面向鏡頭擺出精靈表情。楊洛婷亦高興地寫道：「精神晒！My little KOL in training....」，可見中醫治療十分奏效，細仔隨即恢復元氣，重新變回活潑機靈的「小KOL」。</p><figure><img alt=\"楊洛婷同老公樂隊Dear Jane主音Tim黃天翱育有一子一女。（IG：@rabeeayeung）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250509/997572732440940544796305.jpeg/GUJaoJI5qdiNMwNnmevcejbb_nwFj3KG5-AvWOfgL1g\"/><figcaption>楊洛婷同老公樂隊Dear Jane主音Tim黃天翱育有一子一女。（IG：@rabeeayeung）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"溫馨！（IG@rabeeayeung）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260701/1149019222601764864610397.png/ZXR04h3msOwT6gBANG7urTZMR4n6fp6RR7ffuEe337g\"/><figcaption>溫馨！（IG@rabeeayeung）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"兩旁更掛滿了一家四口的甜蜜合照。（IG@rabeeayeung）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260701/1149019215462666240126984.png/7ob0ZauL4ryDnVllF9y2v3Fn8QBN5DBNLhQ33y4UN98\"/><figcaption>兩旁更掛滿了一家四口的甜蜜合照。（IG@rabeeayeung）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"9歲Tanya穿同款泳衣出海。（IG@rabeeayeung）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260806/1161985317356441600235689.jpeg/We922AqssqLLQ6zhyNRwhPO7C7UIDD5Bx_CplsfwqZY\"/><figcaption>9歲Tanya穿同款泳衣出海。（IG@rabeeayeung）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"船上甲板擺Pose打卡。（IG@rabeeayeung）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260806/1161985640267517952192570.jpeg/1gvNghGpV-oPZqVEHRgKVwKPmDNXjwxZYThvvWE4b70\"/><figcaption>船上甲板擺Pose打卡。（IG@rabeeayeung）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-10T10:18:19.620123+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":730,"images":8,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}